{"id":"vod_sn_37581","vodId":"37581","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"EVA爆笑学园","name_cn":"EVA爆笑学园","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/30f5fc25a7ddbb6ecede2dfb789629b2.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一所名叫第3新东京世立NERV学园中，校长是严肃又寡言的碇原度（立木文彦 配音）。作为校长的儿子，碇真嗣（绪方惠美 配音）感到压力很大。于此同时，来自外国的红发转学生明日香（宫村优子 配音），分裂成三个、以姐妹的形式出场的凌波丽（林原惠美 配音）都给碇真嗣的学校生活带来了翻天覆地的变化。此外，在原作中高大帅气的初号机，也将以娇小可爱的形象，作为学院的一份子出现在动画中。　　动画以《新世界福音战士》中的角色为原型，一改原作沉重严肃的气氛，描述了轻松愉快的校园生活。制作方首次采用了3D的Q版造型，配以实景背景和2D拼接，造就了多元化的绘画风格。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3AMGA8eNaX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F0NQEv3f5t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3rvq5UvfzB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FBvPJHPpPq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JfTEYQYr0h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u5idVaJJji1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5SQ3HedhSf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NJXJc1q45u1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N6ak9Rtka51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n6r5GxD60m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vDabLXrKxs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HSTbsXEtZV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jSsLCUhfNW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ReJCN4Ywmj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","ur